### Requests I use while testing locally (VS / Rider http client)
### Run "docker compose up" first, then log in and paste the token below

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Register a new user (gets the Member role)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "Password1"
}

### Login as the seeded admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@taskmanager.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List users (admin / manager)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=10&search=jane
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Promote a user to Manager (admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/2/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Manager"
}

### Create a project (admin / manager)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Website redesign",
  "description": "New landing page and pricing page"
}

### Add a member to a project
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2
}

### Create a task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "title": "Design the pricing page",
  "description": "3 plans, monthly/yearly toggle",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "assigneeId": 2
}

### List tasks with filters + sorting + paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?projectId=1&status=Todo&sortBy=dueDate&sortDirection=asc&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My open tasks that are overdue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?assignedToMe=true&isOverdue=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Move a task to In Progress
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### Unassign a task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1/assignee
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneeId": null
}

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
